Cell["\<\
The diluted tree: every vertex has one child, except at the depths 0, 3, 8 \
and 15, one less than the squares, where it has two.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8d1cc0a8-4718-4022-a82a-dac92c05b49c"],

